# Code of Conduct
## Our Pledge
We are committed to providing an open, friendly and inclusive community for all developers and contributors.

## Behavioral Standards
- Respect every member of the community
- Communicate politely and focus on technical discussion
- Do not publish discriminatory, offensive or abusive content
- Maintain a positive and rigorous open-source atmosphere

## Enforcement
The project maintainer has the right to remove inappropriate content and reject irregular contributions to ensure the healthy development of the open-source project.
